{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08074","headline":"塞下曲六首 四 · 李白","name":"塞下曲六首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白马黄金塞，云砂遶梦思。\n那堪愁苦节，远忆边城儿。\n萤飞秋窗满，月度霜闺迟。\n摧残梧桐叶，萧飒沙棠枝。\n无时独不见，流泪空自知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08074.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08074","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}